@startuml 04-send-report-sequence
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
title Sending a report (student to evaluator)

actor Student
participant "Student's browser" as B
participant "STMA server" as S
database "Database" as DB
collections "File storage" as FS

Student -> B : choose report file
B -> B : 1. sign file with student's\nsigning PRIVATE key (RSA-PSS, SHA-256)
B -> B : 2. package = signature length + signature + file
B -> B : 3. make random 8-byte DES key and 8-byte IV,\nencrypt package (DES-CBC, PKCS#7 padding)
B -> B : 4. encrypt DES key with evaluator's\nencryption PUBLIC key (RSA-OAEP)
B -> S : 5. upload ciphertext, IV, wrapped DES key,\nIDs of the two public keys (HTTPS)
S -> S : check sender is in the relationship,\nkeys belong to the right users, sizes are valid
S -> FS : save ciphertext under a random name
S -> DB : insert row into documents
S --> B : 201 Created
B --> Student : "Report encrypted, signed,\nand uploaded successfully"

note over S, FS
  The server never sees the file,
  the signature or the DES key.
end note
@enduml
